# A new orc Rogue 1 with Dexterity 11 takes Weapon Finesse in his first feat
# choice, then saves so the check can read the feat off the character sheet.
# bd inc-dkbaw, tools/check_weapon_finesse_prereq.sh.
#
# THE RULE UNDER TEST: Weapon Finesse has no prerequisites (Pathfinder 1e Core
# Rulebook). Before inc-dkbaw src/FeatTab.cpp required Dexterity 13 and melee BAB
# +1, or CA_UNARMED_STRIKE. A Rogue 1 has melee BAB +0, so the feat was never
# offered to him. This script RUNS the chargen: the offer is computed at
# generation time, so a frozen .sav would hide a FeatTab change.
#
# ATTRIBUTES: Point Buy, so no seed changes them. Costs rise with the score:
# DEX 8->11 is 3 points, STR 8->17 is the rest. The attribute screen's totals
# are STR 17, DEX 11, CON 18, INT 18, WIS 12, CHA 16, LUC 17 (the orc modifies
# STR, INT, WIS and CHA; DEX stays 11, below the old requirement of 13).
#
# THE FEAT LIST HAS TWO PAGES (51 of 55 feats on the first). "Weapon Finesse"
# sorts after "Talented", so TAB moves to the page that holds it, and it is the
# first row there ([a]). It is chosen by letter and not by @choose, because
# @choose aborts the whole script (harness exit 6) when the feat is not offered,
# and the check needs a finished session to fail on, not a script error. When
# the feat is not offered, [a] is Weapon Focus and the check reads the menu.
# ponytail: the page split (51 per page) and the sort order fix the letter; if
# either moves, the check's "[a] Weapon Finesse" menu assertion fails loudly.

a       # Initial Choices: [a] Create a New Character
n       # Alter the character generation options? -- no
y       # Explore Mode. Continue? -- yes
@choose "Orc"
@choose "Orc (Standard)"
@choose "Rogue"
p       # Abort to Point Buy; every attribute starts at 8, with 75 points
RIGHT*9 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*10 DOWN RIGHT*10 DOWN RIGHT*4 DOWN RIGHT*8 DOWN RIGHT*9
@dump:points
ENTER
y       # Are these your final stats? -- yes
@choose "Neutral"
@dump:feat-page1
TAB
@dump:feat-page2
a       # [a] Weapon Finesse, the first row of page 2
# Second feat, and any prompt the first choice raised (Weapon Focus, taken when
# Weapon Finesse is not offered, asks for a weapon group): press [a] until the
# Skill Manager opens, so a failing run still finishes chargen.
@until "Skill Manager" a

RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN RIGHT*3 DOWN
ENTER y # Done, and confirm keeping the ranks

y       # Do you wish to worship <god>? -- yes
@while "personality archetype" a

@until "System Menu" ESC
@expect "System Menu"
b       # [b] Save and Continue
@dump:saved
